        "In Arabic, the prefix 'al-' makes a word definite",
        "With the 14 sun letters, the 'l' sound changes to the sound of that letter (ar-, as-, an-...)",
        "With the 14 moon letters, 'al-' stays as it is",
        "Practical rule: if your tongue touches the roof of your mouth, it is a sun letter",
        "This rule applies in the Beautiful Names of Allah, the adhan, and the Quran",
        "In tajweed, these are called the sun lam and the moon lam"
